  "APIProfile": "Basic",
  "Description": "Audio Scene Manager: acquires audio, edits it into Objects, composes Objects into a Scene, and delivers the Scene. Composite of AOA + AOE + ASE + ASD, all reading/writing through the shared Repository. UNLIKE MMC-AMQ, this composite is NOT executed via AIF.Controller/MachineExecutor as a run-to-completion pipeline: a user builds/edits Objects and Scenes on demand, in whatever order, via ASMApp, which hosts the Repository and calls directly into the live AOA/AOE/ASE/ASD instances. The Topology below documents the intended logical data flow for registration/documentation purposes; it does not drive execution the way it does for MMC-AMQ.",
